      "writtenOn": "2024-11-14T21:44:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think if the validation test below with your suggested fix works, the wire should be working properly so maybe it\u0027s ok?\n\nBut I agree that this field shouldn\u0027t actually be optional here.",
